            <![CDATA[
                    <p><img src="https://hugohalle.com/media/posts/38/VideoGhastlies_KeyArt_1440_16x9_NoLogo.jpg" class="type:primaryImage" alt="" /></p>
                <div class="project-text formatted-text container-sm">
<p>Key Art for the upcoming horror game Dead Format.</p>
<div class="project-description">
<p>Indie Publisher <a href="https://www.orointeractive.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ORO Interactive</a> approached me to help them create the key art for the exciting horror title Video Ghastlies. <br>Their pitch was to produce an image evocative of the 80s horror-film VHS covers. Hard to say no to that.</p>
<p>Beside the main artwork, I also delivered the variations designed to be integrated in Steam.</p>
</div>
